// Loomx ESP-NOW backup channel: message codec, HMAC-SHA256 signing (truncated
// tag), replay protection, time-base estimation and channel scanning. Pure
// C++ shared by NodeFW and Form (identical copy) and host-tested by
// tools/loomx-espnow-test.js. Frames are broadcast (ESP-NOW encrypts at most
